=== SURVEY ===
================================================================================
Web source of truth (FleetStatsBarWidget.tsx) — read end-to-end:
  Composition: <WidgetShell title icon loading error updatedAt isFetching isStale
    isError onRefresh>  { hasData ? <WidgetStatGrid stats cols=4 compact> : <EmptyState> }
  Data sources (hooks): useVehicles, useFleetAnalytics(30), useUnits (useTranslation
    for i18n). Derived stats: vehicleCount, onlineCount (state==='online'),
    totalDistance (convertDistanceFromSI of analytics.total_distance_km),
    totalEnergy (analytics.total_energy_kwh). onlinePct = online/total*100.
  4 StatGridItem: Vehicles (icon Car, trend "<n> online"), Online Now (icon Wifi,
    trend "<pct>%"), Distance (30d) (icon Route, unit=distanceUnit), Energy (30d)
    (icon Zap, unit kWh). hasData = vehicles.length>0 || analytics. Empty →
    EmptyState(icon Car, message "No fleet data available").
  States exercised by the source: loading (WidgetShell.loading), error
    (WidgetShell.error), fetching/stale/freshness chrome (DataFreshness via
    isFetching/isStale/isError/updatedAt + onRefresh refetch), empty (EmptyState),
    data (StatGrid). Prompt's required state set: loading, empty, error, stale, offline.
  i18n namespace 'dashboard', 7 keys: widget.fleetStatsBar.{title, vehicles, online,
    onlineNow, distance30d, energy30d, noData}.

